+# SLICE AAB-004 — Manual Proposal Review & Approval Policy
+
+## Мета
+Створити human-in-the-loop policy для TaskDNA Proposals, щоб жодна
+чернетка, створена з AAB, не могла стати execution task без явного
+рішення Максима.
+
+## Scope
+Дозволено створити лише:
+- docs/specs/DNK_TASKDNA_PROPOSAL_REVIEW_POLICY_v1.0.md
+- docs/schemas/taskdna_proposal_review.schema.yaml
+- docs/tech/taskdna_proposals/reviews/
+- docs/tech/taskdna_proposals/reviews/README.md
+- core/aab/proposal_review.py
+- scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py
+- tests/aab/test_aab_proposal_review.py
+- docs/audit/AAB_PROPOSAL_REVIEW_POLICY_v1.0_evidence.json
+- docs/notes/099_aab_proposal_review_policy_v1_0.md
+
+## Заборонено
+- Не створювати реальні TaskDNA tasks.
+- Не змінювати task_triage, Task Forest, Swarm, API, UI або runtime.
+- Не запускати агентів, tools чи external services.
+- Не змінювати AAB blocks.
+- Не змінювати catalog.db.
+- Не переводити proposal в approved без explicit CLI approval input.
+
+## Status lifecycle
+draft → reviewed → approved | rejected
+
+Rules:
+1. Лише proposal зі status=draft може отримати review.
+2. `reviewed` не означає дозвіл на виконання.
+3. `approved` дозволений лише з:
+   - reviewer: "maksym"
+   - decision: "approved"
+   - reviewed_at: ISO-8601 UTC
+   - rationale: non-empty
+   - risks_accepted: non-empty list або explicit empty list
+4. `rejected` також потребує rationale.
+5. Existing proposal file є immutable:
+   - не змінювати його status;
+   - review зберігається окремим файлом.
+6. Один proposal може мати кілька reviews,
+   але лише останній valid review визначає current decision.
+7. CLI не має автоматично створювати task після approval.
+
+## Review File
+Один review = один YAML-файл:
+
+docs/tech/taskdna_proposals/reviews/
+  <proposal_id>/
+    REVIEW-<UTC-timestamp>-<slug>.yaml
+
+Мінімальна модель:
+
+```yaml
+schema_version: "dnk-taskdna-proposal-review/v1.0"
+review_id: "TDR-YYYYMMDD-<slug>"
+proposal_id: "TDP-YYYYMMDD-<slug>"
+decision: "approved" # reviewed | approved | rejected
+reviewer: "maksym"
+reviewed_at: "ISO-8601 UTC"
+rationale: ""
+risks_accepted: []
+conditions_before_execution: []
+linked_evidence: []
+```
+
+## CLI
+Підтримати:
+
+```bash
+# Read-only review summary
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py show <proposal-id>
+
+# Create neutral technical review, does not approve
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py review <proposal-id> \
+  --rationale "..."
+
+# Explicit human approval, creates review record only
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py approve <proposal-id> \
+  --reviewer maksym \
+  --rationale "..." \
+  --risk "..." \
+  --condition "..."
+
+# Explicit rejection
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py reject <proposal-id> \
+  --reviewer maksym \
+  --rationale "..."
+```
+
+Requirements:
+- `approve` must require `--reviewer maksym`;
+- no default approval;
+- all review files validated by Pydantic + JSON Schema;
+- output states clearly: “No TaskDNA execution task was created”;
+- support `--json`;
+- use only repo-relative paths.
+
+## Tests
+At minimum:
+1. Draft proposal can receive neutral review.
+2. Draft proposal cannot become approved without reviewer=maksym.
+3. Approval without rationale fails.
+4. Rejection without rationale fails.
+5. Approval creates a separate immutable review file.
+6. Original proposal remains status=draft.
+7. Latest valid review determines decision.
+8. CLI show/review/approve/reject works.
+9. No TaskDNA runtime modules are imported or changed.
+
+## Verification
+```bash
+./.venv/bin/python3 -m pytest tests/aab -v
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py show <proposal-id>
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py review <proposal-id> \
+  --rationale "Technical review complete"
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/review_taskdna_proposal.py approve <proposal-id> \
+  --reviewer maksym \
+  --rationale "Approved for future planning only" \
+  --condition "No runtime mutation in this phase"
+git diff --check
+```
