+
+## Certification Requirements
+
+Для переходу `evaluated → active` плагін має мати:
+
+1. Valid Plugin Card v1.0.
+2. Contract tests:
+   - tests/plugins/<plugin_id>/test_<plugin_id>.py
+   - green у CI або локально.
+3. Security review:
+   - опис ризиків, permissions обґрунтовано,
+   - secrets, network, git, database, external_write явно описані.
+4. Evidence artifacts:
+   - contract_test_evidence.md
+   - security_review.md
+   - activation_approval.md (затвердження Максимом).
+5. Відомий owner.
+6. Ліцензія:
+   - internal: DNK-INTERNAL
+   - open_source: SPDX license
+   - vendor: license / agreement reference
+   - generated: provenance note.
+
+## Certification Model
+
+Створи Pydantic модель:
+
+```yaml
+plugin_id: ""
+plugin_version: ""
+lifecycle_from: "evaluated"
+lifecycle_to: "active"
+
+contract_tests:
+  path: "tests/plugins/<plugin_id>/test_<plugin_id>.py"
+  status: "green"
+  last_run_at: "2026-09-09T18:00:00Z"
+
+security_review:
+  path: "templates/plugin/evidence/security_review.md"
+  reviewer: "gerych_prime"
+  reviewed_at: "2026-09-09T18:00:00Z"
+  risk_level: "low"
+  notes: ""
+
+activation_approval:
+  path: "templates/plugin/evidence/activation_approval.md"
+  approver: "maksym"
+  approved_at: "2026-09-09T18:00:00Z"
+  approval_record: ""
+
+evidence_paths:
+  - "templates/plugin/evidence/contract_test_evidence.md"
+  - "templates/plugin/evidence/security_review.md"
+  - "templates/plugin/evidence/activation_approval.md"
+
+certified_at: "2026-09-09T18:00:00Z"
+certified_by: "gerych_prime"
+```
+
+## CLI
+
+```bash
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/plugin_certification.py check \
+  --plugin-id plugin-example-001 \
+  --card templates/plugin/plugin_card.yaml \
+  --evidence-dir templates/plugin/evidence
+
+./.venv/bin/python3 scripts/system/plugin_certification.py generate-evidence \
+  --plugin-id plugin-example-001 \
+  --output-dir templates/plugin/evidence
