+
+## Intake Flow
+
+```text
+GitHub URL (user-provided)
+→ fetch metadata (mocked in tests)
+→ generate Plugin Card template
+→ set lifecycle: sandbox
+→ set origin.type: open_source
+→ set license_spdx from repo metadata
+→ set repository_url, commit_sha
+→ save to templates/plugin/github/<plugin_id>_card.yaml
+→ output: "Plugin imported as sandbox, requires evaluation"
+```
