+## Protocol Model
+
+Створи Pydantic моделі:
+
+```yaml
+CanvasMessage:
+  message_id: ""
+  timestamp: "2026-09-09T23:00:00Z"
+  message_type: "canvas.state.update"
+  # canvas.state.update | canvas.node.add | canvas.node.remove
+  # canvas.node.move | canvas.edge.add | canvas.edge.remove
+  # canvas.conflict | canvas.ack
+  sender_id: ""
+  # gerych_prime | maksym | system | <agent_id>
+  payload: {}
+  # node, edge, state тощо
+
+CanvasStateUpdate:
+  canvas_id: ""
+  version: "v0.1"
+  state: {}
+  # повний CanvasState
+
+CanvasNodeOperation:
+  operation: "add"
+  # add | remove | move | update
+  node: {}
+  # CanvasNode
+
+CanvasEdgeOperation:
+  operation: "add"
+  # add | remove | update
+  edge: {}
+  # CanvasEdge
+
+CanvasConflict:
+  conflict_id: ""
+  path: "nodes.0.position.x"
+  base_value: 0
+  local_value: 100
+  remote_value: 200
+  resolution: "manual"
+
+CanvasAck:
+  message_id: ""
+  status: "accepted"
+  # accepted | rejected | conflict
+  reason: null
+```
+
+## Message Flow
+
+```text
+Client A                         Server                         Client B
+   |                               |                               |
+   |--- canvas.node.add ---------->|                               |
+   |                               |--- canvas.node.add --------->|
+   |<-- canvas.ack (accepted) -----|                               |
+   |                               |                               |
+   |                               |<-- canvas.node.move ---------|
+   |<-- canvas.node.move ----------|                               |
+   |                               |                               |
+   |--- canvas.node.move --------->|                               |
+   |                               |<-- canvas.conflict ----------|
+   |<-- canvas.conflict -----------|                               |
+```
+
+## WebSocket vs SSE
+
+- **WebSocket**: двосторонній зв'язок (клієнт → сервер → клієнт);
+- **SSE**: односторонній (сервер → клієнт), простіший для оновлень стану;
